{"id":"belleza","lemma":"belleza","pos":"noun","rank":1098,"glosses":["beauty (the quality of being beautiful)","beauty (beautiful person or object)"],"ipa":"/beˈʝeθa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"bellezas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ac/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-belleza.wav","examples":[{"text":"Ella es una belleza.","en":"She's a beauty.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442006"},{"text":"También es una belleza.","en":"She's also a beauty.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/636567"},{"text":"La belleza es subjetiva.","en":"Beauty is subjective.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/454323"},{"text":"Ella es una verdadera belleza.","en":"She is a real beauty.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/453426"},{"text":"La belleza no es importante.","en":"Beauty isn't important.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460880"}]}